---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="bg-[#f9f9f9]">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-24 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-[72px] relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="">Key Tools to Boost Repeat Sales</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">Points, VIP, referrals, gift cards, and store credit work seamlessly together to create the ultimate rewards program for your business.on Hike POS.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-14 mt-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border   border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Hike gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/GC.webp">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-black">Advanced Gifting Options: Physical and Digital</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Customers can buy, send, and personalize branded Gift Cards via Hike POS both in-store and online, using 99minds. Enhance your retail experience with point-of-sale gift cards, offering customers a convenient and versatile option for their purchases.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
          
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border   border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Hike loyalty program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/LP.webp">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Robust and Simple Loyalty Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Introduce a full omni-channel loyalty program on Hike to enhance customer lifetime value and marketing effectiveness. Utilize 99minds to enhance your business's customer engagement by offering rewards and benefits both in-store and online.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border   border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Hike store credit" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/SC.webp">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Store Credit- Convert Refunds Into Revenue</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Offer store credit to your customers on HIke, which can be redeemed both in-store and online.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border   border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Hike referral program" class="text-center"  width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/RF.webp">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Dynamic  Referral Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Create a Hike referral and rewards program that turns customer advocacy into a significant revenue stream through SMS, emails, social media, and additional channels.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border   border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Hike coupons" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/CG.webp">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Powerful Coupon Generator</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Bulk, dynamic & personalize coupon generation for your store.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border   border-gray-200">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Hike POS" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/POS.webp">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Seamless POS Integration</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Integrated seamlessly with Hike POS, 99minds operates smoothly both in-store and online, alongside your chosen eCommerce platform, simplifying your retail management effortlessly.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
    </div>
  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto  sm:flex-row">
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 lg:mt-10">
          <a href="https://giftcard.99minds.io/access/register" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-black absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds for free</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
      </div>
</section>
